Written Statement
The proposed zoning amendment will allow
construction of a single family dwelling (DD8) on each
lot. The current MR zoning only allows a twinhome
style of construction with a partition wall on the
middle lot line.
After careful consideration I believe the project's
highest and best use will be the single family
detached DD8 dwelling per lot. The only DD8 use by
right is NR2 and NR3. The lots are already platted and
if approved the density remains the same.
FYI the supporting document photo is not specific to
the site it is an example of what I'd like to build.
Thank you,
Brandon
